* Reduced-order LLC resonant stage — portfolio model
* 800 V DC link, full-bridge square-wave excitation, ideal transformer approximation
.param VBUS=800 FSW=120k LR=25u CR=70n LM=150u RLOAD=16.667
Vbus bus 0 {VBUS}
Vdrive sw 0 PULSE(-400 400 0 50n 50n {0.5/FSW} {1/FSW})
Lr sw nres {LR}
Cr nres pri {CR}
Lm pri 0 {LM}
* Transformer and rectifier represented by reflected resistive load for first-pass tank study
Rref pri 0 {RLOAD}
.tran 0 2m 0 50n
.meas tran IIN_RMS RMS I(Vdrive) FROM 1m TO 2m
.meas tran PIN AVG PARAM '-V(sw)*I(Vdrive)' FROM 1m TO 2m
.step param FSW list 80k 100k 120k 140k 160k
.end

